OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 19 FEB
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GThe Trio Orelon play Beethoven's
OL,11,     Gmonumental Archduke Trio, the
OL,12,     GRotterdam Philharmonic play
OL,13,     GMozart Symphony No.39, plus more
OL,14,     Gfestive music for Brass Band.
OL,15,G1600FComposer of the Week: Rachmaninov
OL,16,     GRachmaninov builds a new home in
OL,17,     GSwitzerland, a villa called
OL,18,     GSenar, which attempts to recreate
OL,19,     Gaspects of the Russian home he'd
OL,20,     Ghad to leave behind.
